{"id":"aprendiz","lemma":"aprendiz","pos":"noun","rank":4699,"glosses":["apprentice (a trainee, especially in a skilled trade)"],"ipa":"/a.pɾẽˈd͡ʒis/","gender":"mf","forms":{"plural":"aprendizes"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/95/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Jessie_Edwin_Lawrence-aprendiz.wav","examples":[{"text":"Eu era o aprendiz de Tom.","en":"I was Tom's apprentice.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/535148","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"tone"}]},{"text":"Somos todos eternos aprendizes.","en":"We are all perpetual learners.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1267904","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"everyone"},{"g":"eternal","l":"eterno"},null]},{"text":"Tom passou uma década como aprendiz.","en":"Tom spent a decade as an apprentice.","words":[{"g":"tone"},{"g":"to pass","l":"passar"},{"g":"a","l":"um"},{"g":"ten"},{"g":"how / like"},null]}]}